h observations passed.","evidence_ids":["cmd-9350cc92f7274573","cmd-9a34a7209a6346a9","cmd-7460ccc625c846ca","global:after_executor:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node2:platform","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health"]}],"confidence":0.99,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1.0,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. Package installation, proxy/origin configuration, dedicated service-account creation, source-scoped firewall rules, service enablement, bounded test artifacts, and mandated restarts all have clear roles. The initial origin unit creation was subsequently hardened before use; the failed sysusers attempt stopped at the missing-directory redirection with no evidenced mutation. Test artifacts were removed, package health remained clean, and neither node had failed services. Both mandatory restart protocols are complete and coherent: healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged restart, changed boot identity matching the fixed lifecycle cross-check, and recovered services, configuration/data, firewall state, and end-to-end policy behavior.","evidence_ids":["cmd-7460ccc625c846ca","cmd-147aaf475a854520","cmd-3cf8a3c1bd034da2","cmd-14f810eac3f941fa","cmd-3cf45a7180994607","cmd-3ecbc1022df4438e","cmd-fb3aa5f7011a425b","cmd-ca054c7404a3479a","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_prepare:node2:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct final-state and behavioral evidence. The approved handbook is preserved and reachable from node2 through node1:3128, destination restrictions and CONNECT rejection work, both services persist across restarts, and the OS release and kernel remain unchanged. Provider-wide restart evidence is complete for both managed nodes.","limitations":["Rejected-port behavior was directly sampled on several representative ports rather than every possible TCP port; the blanket allow-only-8081/deny-all configuration and consistent 403 results provide strong supporting coverage."]}
